{"4655470": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "16叠谋杀之谜", "steam_appid": 4655470, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a single-player interactive short drama game of the detective puzzle murder mystery genre, where beyond solving puzzles in each session, the gameplay also drives the story forward.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>【玩法&amp;特色】</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >这是一款推理解谜类型的互动短剧游戏，单局解谜之外推动剧情演绎。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4655470/extras/41c4ceb1bbd1df4894626dfabe3367f5.poster.avif?t=1783737870\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4655470/extras/41c4ceb1bbd1df4894626dfabe3367f5.webm?t=1783737870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4655470/extras/41c4ceb1bbd1df4894626dfabe3367f5.mp4?t=1783737870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >玩家每完成一个解谜关卡，即可解锁后续的剧情视频进行观赏，从而推动剧情的发展。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4655470/extras/0f03ad664e10275ccc343cc42641225b.poster.avif?t=1783737870\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4655470/extras/0f03ad664e10275ccc343cc42641225b.webm?t=1783737870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4655470/extras/0f03ad664e10275ccc343cc42641225b.mp4?t=1783737870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  游戏中解谜关卡是提供若干张牌，玩家在阅读后进行投凶和谜题获取分数。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4655470/extras/dca13f33c3f0e658816411228a132c9e.poster.avif?t=1783737870\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4655470/extras/dca13f33c3f0e658816411228a132c9e.webm?t=1783737870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4655470/extras/dca13f33c3f0e658816411228a132c9e.mp4?t=1783737870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >剧情扑朔迷离，表面上游戏中的角色在玩一个线上沉浸式的解谜游戏，实则身处另一层迷局之中。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4655470/extras/b1e6d17095ee519dcabd67887f9650fa.poster.avif?t=1783737870\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4655470/extras/b1e6d17095ee519dcabd67887f9650fa.webm?t=1783737870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4655470/extras/b1e6d17095ee519dcabd67887f9650fa.mp4?t=1783737870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >游戏提供多个结局，谜题关卡的探索度影响多结局的释放。分数越多，关卡探索度越高。玩家需要在更深入地了解每个解谜关卡内容才能完成回答更多探索谜题。游戏提供剧情CG和游戏背景信息的搜集系统。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a single-player interactive short drama game of the detective puzzle murder mystery genre, where beyond solving puzzles in each session, the gameplay also drives the story forward.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>【玩法&amp;特色】</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >这是一款推理解谜类型的互动短剧游戏，单局解谜之外推动剧情演绎。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4655470/extras/41c4ceb1bbd1df4894626dfabe3367f5.poster.avif?t=1783737870\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4655470/extras/41c4ceb1bbd1df4894626dfabe3367f5.webm?t=1783737870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4655470/extras/41c4ceb1bbd1df4894626dfabe3367f5.mp4?t=1783737870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >玩家每完成一个解谜关卡，即可解锁后续的剧情视频进行观赏，从而推动剧情的发展。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4655470/extras/0f03ad664e10275ccc343cc42641225b.poster.avif?t=1783737870\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4655470/extras/0f03ad664e10275ccc343cc42641225b.webm?t=1783737870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4655470/extras/0f03ad664e10275ccc343cc42641225b.mp4?t=1783737870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  游戏中解谜关卡是提供若干张牌，玩家在阅读后进行投凶和谜题获取分数。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4655470/extras/dca13f33c3f0e658816411228a132c9e.poster.avif?t=1783737870\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4655470/extras/dca13f33c3f0e658816411228a132c9e.webm?t=1783737870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4655470/extras/dca13f33c3f0e658816411228a132c9e.mp4?t=1783737870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >剧情扑朔迷离，表面上游戏中的角色在玩一个线上沉浸式的解谜游戏，实则身处另一层迷局之中。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4655470/extras/b1e6d17095ee519dcabd67887f9650fa.poster.avif?t=1783737870\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4655470/extras/b1e6d17095ee519dcabd67887f9650fa.webm?t=1783737870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4655470/extras/b1e6d17095ee519dcabd67887f9650fa.mp4?t=1783737870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >游戏提供多个结局，谜题关卡的探索度影响多结局的释放。分数越多，关卡探索度越高。玩家需要在更深入地了解每个解谜关卡内容才能完成回答更多探索谜题。游戏提供剧情CG和游戏背景信息的搜集系统。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Sixteen Layers of Mini Murder&quot; is a video adventure game of the detective puzzle genre, where level-based puzzles drive the story's progression through video narration. Players must complete the level puzzles and uncover the identities of the various participants in order to clear the game.", "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4655470/06e55494de00868dac4968b42b2624e60bac4332/header.jpg?t=1783737870", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4655470/074f8336da57870e653a342bc98ed44a85a485c5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783737870", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4655470/074f8336da57870e653a342bc98ed4